30\"]}],\"target\":{\"status\":\"RANGES\",\"ranges\":[{\"start\":\"2012-06-01\",\"end\":\"2012-08-31\"}],\"cite\":[\"C17:L22-L24\",\"C17:L33\",\"C17:L124-L130\",\"C17:L133-L168\",\"C17:L196-L199\"]},\"cells\":{\"status\":\"ALL_SEA_CELLS\",\"missing_boxes\":[],\"missing_rule\":\"\",\"cite\":[\"C17:L31\",\"C17:L45-L47\",\"C17:L93-L99\",\"C17:L127-L130\",\"C17:L197-L199\"]},\"exceptions\":{\"status\":\"NONE\",\"items\":[]},\"summary\":\"In C17 the mask comes from comparing every target-day SST (2012-06-01..08-31) of every sea cell against threshold_smooth for doys 153-244. Those thresholds are 31-day wrapped means of the raw Hazen P90 for doys 138-259. Each of those raw values is pooled from \u00b15-day windows, so the baseline SST that reaches the mask is 13 May to 20 Sep of each year 1992-2002. The climatology is computed but not used in the mask.\"}",
